%% Adapted from NVIDIA-NeMo/Gym PR #3917 at d40a554c0d9dad9cc1769c9246a2f4fd8bca380a; Apache-2.0.
sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Environment Server<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant R as Resources Server<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant A as Agent Server<br/>(FastAPI adapter)
    participant S as Task sandbox<br/>(provider runtime)
    participant M as Model Server<br/>(FastAPI)

    Note over R,S: Provider examples: OpenSandbox HTTP(S), OpenShell gRPC,<br/>Docker CLI, Local subprocess
    E->>R: HTTP/JSON: POST /seed_session
    R->>S: Provider API/CLI: create, exec, upload
    R-->>E: HTTP/JSON: SandboxAccess
    E->>A: HTTP/JSON: POST /v1/agent_sessions
    A->>S: Provider exec/files: reuse or install runtime
    E->>A: HTTP/JSON: POST .../v1/responses
    A->>S: Provider upload + exec: stage input, launch supervisor
    loop Model and tool calls
        S->>M: HTTP/JSON: POST .../v1/chat/completions
        M-->>S: HTTP/JSON: model response
        S->>S: SDK / local subprocess: execute tools
    end
    A->>S: Provider exec: stop/check process-tree cleanup
    S-->>A: Provider download: cleanup.json (JSON receipt)
    A->>S: Provider download: collect output and observations
    S-->>A: File bytes: harness JSON and artifacts
    A-->>E: HTTP/JSON: Responses API result
    E->>A: HTTP/JSON: POST /v1/agent_sessions/close
    A->>S: Provider exec + disconnect: release session
    A-->>E: HTTP/JSON: close result and observations
    E->>R: HTTP/JSON: POST /verify
    Note over R,S: SWE-Pro: export patch, stop task sandbox A,<br/>then grade in fresh sandbox B (not drawn)
    R-->>E: HTTP/JSON: reward and grading evidence
    E->>R: HTTP/JSON: POST /close_session
    R->>S: Provider API/CLI: stop sandbox if still present
